  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <header class="text-center mb-16 animate-fade-in">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">About</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">Learn about Penta Housing Co-Op and the cooperative housing movement that makes communities like ours possible.</p>
    </header>
    <section class="mb-20"><div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 animate-fade-in"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 text-center">About Penta</h2><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
      <div><h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-6">Our Story</h3><p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">Penta Housing Co-Op began in 1974 when a group of dedicated individuals incorporated the Penta Co-operative Housing Association with a vision to create an inclusive, sustainable community. Through determination and community spirit, they overcame initial setbacks, including a rejected rezoning application, to eventually secure and develop our current site.</p><p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">After years of planning and community building, our cooperative welcomed its first residents in September 1978. Today, 20 families call Penta home, continuing that legacy of cooperation, environmental stewardship, and mutual support.</p><p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">Our residents come from diverse backgrounds but share common values of community, sustainability, and affordable housing that make our cooperative thrive.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6"><div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-4 text-center"><div class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-600">1978</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Established</div></div><div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-4 text-center"><div class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-600">20</div><div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Families</div></div></div><a href="/apply.html" class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 bg-green-600 text-white rounded-md hover:bg-green-700">Join Our Community</a></div>
      <aside class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-emerald-50 shadow-lg border border-green-100 rounded-lg p-6"><h3 class="flex items-center text-xl font-semibold mb-5"><svg class="h-6 w-6 text-green-600 mr-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.7l-1.1-1.1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 7.8L12 21l8.9-8.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-.1-7.8Z"/></svg>Our Values</h3><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex items-start"><svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.9M16 3.1a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.8"/></svg><div><h4 class="font-semibold">Community First</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">We prioritize collective well-being and shared decision-making</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 19 2 19 2c0 1.8-.5 3.5-1.4 5"/><path d="M2 21c0-3 1.9-5.4 4.8-6.4C8.7 10.8 12 8 16 7"/></svg><div><h4 class="font-semibold">Environmental Responsibility</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Sustainable practices and eco-friendly living are core to our mission</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2Z"/><path d="M9 22v-6h6v6"/></svg><div><h4 class="font-semibold">Affordable Housing</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Quality housing should be accessible to everyone</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-8 9-4.5-1.5-8-4-8-9V5l8-3 8 3Z"/></svg><div><h4 class="font-semibold">Inclusive Community</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">We welcome diverse families and foster an environment where everyone belongs</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><svg class="h-5 w-5 text-green-600 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-4.4-7-10a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.6A4 4 0 0 1 19 11c0 5.6-7 10-7 10Z"/><path d="M5 16c2-1 3-2 4-4M15 12c1 2 2 3 4 4"/></svg><div><h4 class="font-semibold">Mutual Support</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Members help each other through shared responsibilities and community care</p></div></div></div></aside>
    </div></div></section>
    <section class="mb-20"><div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-cyan-50 rounded-xl p-8 animate-fade-in"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 text-center">Our Location</h2><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div><div class="flex items-center mb-4"><svg class="h-6 w-6 text-blue-600 mr-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12S4 16 4 10a8 8 0 1 1 16 0Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Near Jericho Beach</h3></div><p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">Penta Housing Co-Op is nestled in Vancouver's peaceful Point Grey neighbourhood, just steps away from the beautiful Jericho Beach. This prime location offers residents the perfect blend of urban convenience and natural tranquility.</p><p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">Jericho Beach is one of Vancouver's most beloved destinations, featuring stunning views of the North Shore mountains and downtown skyline. The large Jericho Park provides a peaceful buffer from city noise while maintaining easy access to all urban amenities.</p><div class="flex items-center text-gray-600 mb-4"><svg class="h-5 w-5 text-blue-500 mr-2 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 6c1.5 1.5 3.5 1.5 5 0s3.5-1.5 5 0 3.5 1.5 5 0 3.5-1.5 5 0"/><path d="M2 12c1.5 1.5 3.5 1.5 5 0s3.5-1.5 5 0 3.5 1.5 5 0 3.5-1.5 5 0"/></svg><span class="text-sm">Year-round access to beach activities including kayaking, sailing, and windsurfing</span></div><div class="flex items-center text-gray-600 mb-6"><svg class="h-5 w-5 text-blue-500 mr-2 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8 3 4 8 3-4 5 9H4Z"/></svg><span class="text-sm">Stunning views of mountains and ocean from the neighbourhood</span></div><a href="https://govancity.com/neighbourhoods/point-grey/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors shadow-md text-sm">Explore Point Grey Neighbourhood Guide</a></div><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Neighbourhood Highlights</h3><div class="space-y-3">{% for item in [{h:'Beach Access',p:'Walking distance to Jericho Beach',i:'waves'},{h:'Transit',p:'Close to UBC campus and transit connections',i:'transit'},{h:'Recreation',p:'Access to parks, trails, and recreational facilities',i:'leaf'},{h:'Shopping',p:'Nearby shopping at West 4th Avenue and Broadway',i:'shopping'},{h:'Schools',p:'Family-friendly community with excellent schools',i:'school'}] %}<div class="flex items-start bg-white rounded-lg p-3 shadow-sm"><svg class="h-5 w-5 text-blue-600 mr-3 mt-1 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">{% if item.i == 'waves' %}<path d="M2 8c1.5 1.5 3.5 1.5 5 0s3.5-1.5 5 0 3.5 1.5 5 0 3.5-1.5 5 0"/><path d="M2 14c1.5 1.5 3.5 1.5 5 0s3.5-1.5 5 0 3.5 1.5 5 0 3.5-1.5 5 0"/>{% elif item.i == 'transit' %}<rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M4 11h16M8 19l-2 2m12-2 2 2M8 7h.01M16 7h.01"/>{% elif item.i == 'leaf' %}<path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 19 2 19 2c0 1.8-.5 3.5-1.4 5"/><path d="M2 21c0-3 1.9-5.4 4.8-6.4C8.7 10.8 12 8 16 7"/>{% elif item.i == 'shopping' %}<path d="M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z"/><path d="M3 6h18M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"/>{% else %}<path d="m22 10-10-5L2 10l10 5Z"/><path d="M6 12v5c3 2 9 2 12 0v-5"/><path d="M22 10v6"/>{% endif %}</svg><div><span class="font-medium">{{ item.h }}</span><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">{{ item.p }}</p></div></div>{% endfor %}</div></div></div></div></section>
    <section><div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 animate-fade-in"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 text-center">About Co-op Housing</h2><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8"><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">What is Co-op Housing?</h3><p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">Housing cooperatives are community-based organizations that provide affordable, secure housing through member ownership and democratic governance. Unlike rental housing, co-op members have a voice in how their housing is managed and maintained.</p><p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">Co-ops operate on the principle that housing should serve people, not profit. This approach keeps costs down while ensuring long-term affordability and community stability.</p></div><div><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Benefits of Co-op Living</h3><div class="space-y-3">{% for benefit in ['Below-market housing costs with stable, predictable fees','Democratic control over housing decisions and policies','Strong sense of community and mutual support','Security of tenure and protection from displacement','Opportunity to develop leadership and governance skills'] %}<div class="flex items-start"><div class="w-2 h-2 bg-green-600 rounded-full mt-2 mr-3 shrink-0"></div><span class="text-gray-600">{{ benefit }}</span></div>{% endfor %}</div></div></div><div class="border-t pt-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 text-center">Learn More About Co-op Housing</h3><p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">For more information about cooperative housing in British Columbia and across Canada, visit these valuable resources:</p><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4"><a href="https://www.chf.bc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-green-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-green-700 transition-colors shadow-md">Co-op Housing Federation of BC</a><a href="https://chfcanada.coop" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-green-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-green-700 transition-colors shadow-md">Co-op Housing Federation of Canada</a></div></div></div></section>
